-- --opens specification (seg/WRITING.md, rule 6) for MapBR (doc/br-universal.pdf,
-- Sections 4 and 6): one entry per declaration, generated from --opened and checked
-- against the note by kind.  Kinds:
--   types and levels: PtMap, PtSec, PtEquiv, Maps.PMO, HC / STr.C / STr.Same /
--     Quot.Q / Quot.image / Trunc.carrier / Trunc.image, Bijection.Fibre / Injective,
--     isConn, isTrunc, isSet, the numerals two / three / four / five, Fibres.Fib / fpt /
--     fpr / OF / FibConn.F;
--   by-definition steps of the text: the local definitions (Ex, Un, U0, qs, F, f0, Ok,
--     ...), ptcomp, ptconst, hcl / STr.inc;
--     by-definition steps of Proposition EBR: Cross.f and Lev.conj (loop-eq), Lev.eBi /
--     pt-inv / Conj.eBi / Conj.conj (eBi-def, conj-bridge), Psi.psi and PhiC (cls,
--     inj-R), H4 / isEquiv (h, eh), Nec.Two.one (FC), the local M, p, ext-pt, pstar;
--     LiftG.Ex / Un, Triple3.F / f0 (ex-BR, un-BR, qBR: LiftG is stated with Fb.Fib);
--     DeloopR.BR / br0 (Sigma structure of BR); NatArith.plus (levels of unique-loop);
--   extras, not steps of the text: KK.pt / EMSpace.pt in PStar.ext-pt (the pointing of
--     K(A,3), as at level 2); the chain KK.K -> EMSpace.K -> EMn.Kstage ->
--     Step.next -> Deloop.Torsors.Tor opened for K(B,5) at a numeral (trunc6), as
--     DeloopR.BR-trunc and Triple.trunc5 (the etaV mechanism,
--     doc/etav-lock-diagnostic.txt: documented, not fixed).
